@startuml
actor Customer
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database PostgreSQL
participant "NVIDIA API" as NVIDIA
Customer -> Frontend: Kirim pesan pertama
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/ai/conversations
Backend -> PostgreSQL: getSession / akun aktif
PostgreSQL --> Backend: user + role
alt sesi/input/pembatas tidak valid
 Backend --> Frontend: 401 / 400 / 429
else valid
 Backend -> PostgreSQL: create conversation + USER
 Backend -> PostgreSQL: konteks terfilter dan katalog
 PostgreSQL --> Backend: data yang diizinkan
 alt scope/deterministik
  Backend -> Backend: penolakan atau tool lokal
 else inferensi AI
  Backend -> NVIDIA: sanitized messages, timeout 25s
  alt provider sukses
   NVIDIA --> Backend: reply
  else error/timeout
   Backend -> Backend: ExpertEngine fallback
  end
 end
 Backend -> PostgreSQL: simpan ASSISTANT
 Backend --> Frontend: 201 conversation + provider aktual
 Frontend --> Customer: Tampilkan jawaban
end
@enduml
